# The genuine positive point line and its threefold pullback

This package supplies the actual dual of the original sphere ideal line,
its globally holomorphic section with sole simple zero at `1`, the actual
Cartier presentation by `t - 1` and `1 - w`, and their holomorphic pullback
along the constructed sphere projection. The pulled-back cocycle is the
literal dual of the existing pulled-back ideal cocycle.
-/
